        "pk": null,
        "html": "<div class=\"gp\" id=\"cbApp\">\n  <section class=\"gp-hero\">\n    <div><span class=\"gp-eye\"><i></i>Cheques wallet &middot; Batches</span><h1>Cheque batches</h1>\n      <p>Every cheque batch uploaded from Excel. Open a batch to review its lines and submit the cheques to the client wallet.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"gp-act\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"gp-btn\" id=\"cbCsv\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><path d=\"M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg><span>Download</span></button>\n      <a class=\"gp-btn gp-btn--hot\" id=\"cbNew\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l-5-5-5 5M12 3v12\"/></svg><span>Upload cheques</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"cb-kpis\" id=\"cbKpis\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cb-k on\" data-k=\"ALL\" style=\"--c:#5F7B8A\"><span class=\"h\"><i></i>All batches</span><b id=\"cbNALL\">&ndash;</b><small>Every upload</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cb-k\" data-k=\"READY\" style=\"--c:#14734F\"><span class=\"h\"><i></i>Ready to submit</span><b id=\"cbNREADY\">&ndash;</b><small>All lines valid</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cb-k\" data-k=\"ERRORS\" style=\"--c:#B42318\"><span class=\"h\"><i></i>With errors</span><b id=\"cbNERRORS\">&ndash;</b><small>Lines to correct</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cb-k\" data-k=\"OPEN\" style=\"--c:#E87722\"><span class=\"h\"><i></i>Not finished</span><b id=\"cbNOPEN\">&ndash;</b><small>Draft / loaded</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cb-k\" data-k=\"SUBMITTED\" style=\"--c:#00636D\"><span class=\"h\"><i></i>Submitted</span><b id=\"cbNSUBMITTED\">&ndash;</b><small>Cheques in the wallet</small></button></div>\n  <div class=\"cb-bar\"><label class=\"cb-q\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"cbQ\" placeholder=\"Search by batch number, customer, Client ID or file name\" aria-label=\"Search batches\"></label><span class=\"cb-count\" id=\"cbCount\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"cb-list\" id=\"cbList\"><div class=\"cb-empty\">Loading&hellip;</div></div>\n</div>",
