        "kind": "html",
        "table": null,
        "pk": null,
        "html": "<div class=\"gp\" id=\"ctApp\">\n  <section class=\"gp-hero\">\n    <div><span class=\"gp-eye\"><i></i>Cheques wallet &middot; Setup</span><h1>Cheque action catalog</h1>\n      <p>The actions that move a cheque: where it may come from, where it goes, which statuses are allowed and what must be entered.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"gp-act\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"gp-btn\" id=\"ctCsv\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><path d=\"M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg><span>Download</span></button><a class=\"gp-btn gp-btn--hot\" id=\"ctNew\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg><span>New action</span></a></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"cb-kpis cx-kpis\" id=\"ctKpis\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))\"></div>\n  <div class=\"cx-tool\"><label class=\"cb-q\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ctQ\" placeholder=\"Search action name, code, location, status or procedure\" aria-label=\"Search actions\"></label><span class=\"cx-sel\"><select id=\"ctEv\" aria-label=\"Event type\"><option value=\"\">All event types</option></select></span><span class=\"cx-sel\"><select id=\"ctTo\" aria-label=\"Target location\"><option value=\"\">All target locations</option></select></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"cx-clear\" id=\"ctClear\">Clear filters</button><span class=\"cb-count\" id=\"ctCount\"></span></div>\n  <div id=\"ctList\"><div class=\"cb-list\"><div class=\"cb-empty\">Loading&hellip;</div></div></div>\n</div>",
        "hideHeader": true,
